{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-02T18:03:10.944Z","data":{"text":"Done. Implemented task 1 within scope.\n\n**Changes**\n- `tests/line-budget-check.ts` (new): `checkLineBudget(sourceDir, allowList, maxLines)` walks `.ts` files (excluding `.d.ts`), counts `split('\\n').length`, and returns messages for unlisted over-limit files, listed paths back within budget, and listed paths that no longer exist. Message paths are relative to the source dir's parent (repo root when called on `src/`).\n- `tests/line-budget.test.ts`: `ALLOW_LIST` now holds the eleven exact `src/`-relative paths per the proposal, with a \"only shrinks\" comment; the source case calls the new helper; UI case untouched.\n- `tests/line-budget-check.test.ts` (new): temp-tree coverage of same-name unlisted over-limit, listed over-limit, listed within budget, missing listed path, clean tree, and `.d.ts` ignored.\n\n**Verification**\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/line-budget-check.test.ts` → 6 pass.\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/line-budget.test.ts` → 2 pass (real tree clean).\n- `pnpm verify` → EXIT=0 (typechecks, build, full test suite, lint).\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/140-line-budget-full-paths/.run/results/1.md`."}}
